m/apps/2633630/extras/c54cd9ee507ccd8c4b64bde3d90c4dcf.poster.avif?t=1729198676\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633630/extras/c54cd9ee507ccd8c4b64bde3d90c4dcf.webm?t=1729198676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633630/extras/c54cd9ee507ccd8c4b64bde3d90c4dcf.mp4?t=1729198676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Transport ores underground with the Tunnel</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633630/extras/b629f5098bfc619ad930df25700ea8d1.poster.avif?t=1729198676\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633630/extras/b629f5098bfc619ad930df25700ea8d1.webm?t=1729198676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633630/extras/b629f5098bfc619ad930df25700ea8d1.mp4?t=1729198676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>5 itens</strong> to use in creating factories;<br></li><li><strong>50 levels</strong> ranging from easy to difficult;<br></li><li>Background music <strong>calm and relaxing</strong> to make your journey more complete;</li></ul>",
